":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"访视策略：筛选（-14至-1天）\n基线/V1（第1天，随机化与基线排尿日记核对）\nV2（第4周，疗效与安全性评估）\nV3/EOT（第8周，主要终点评估）\n随访（第10周，安全性随访）","quote_sha256":"82b87e189020bf26097d59839b709a65fc7390f1e34474f8b34a6d33f1d13f52","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_visit_strategy"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span_project_safety_endpoint","span_project_study_period","span_project_visit_strategy"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目不良事件随访、AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告流程文件后完成本章节。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_ae_followup_001","missing_source_classes":["不良事件随访与安全性报告项目文件"],"target":"8.7 不良事件的随访"}],"heading":"不良事件的随访","missing_source_classes":["不良事件随访与安全性报告项目文件","AE/SAE/SUSAR定义与报告流程"],"proposal_text":"本研究安全性终点包括治疗中出现的不良事件（TEAE）的发生率与严重程度，并在全治疗期进行随访。研究时期包括筛选期、8周双盲治疗期以及2周治疗结束后安全性随访期。访视安排中，V2（第4周）进行疗效与安全性评估，V3/EOT（第8周）进行主要终点评估，第10周进行安全性随访。在V2、V3/EOT和第10周访视中，研究者应按已确认的安全性终点评估并记录TEAE的发生率与严重程度。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的安全性终点、研究时期和访视安排撰写；不良事件的具体定义、记录要求、报告对象、报告时限和随访方式缺少项目文件，需医学确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_e225d48361d28d6f","section_number":"8.7","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9691f7c94f6c58","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9895ed0bd2ffd4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929225633_649743cb","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"入选标准模块：18-80岁男性或绝经后/有避孕措施的女性；符合OAB诊断（尿急伴平均每日排尿≥8次和/或急迫性尿失禁≥3次/72h，3天排尿日记确认）；筛选期平均单次排尿量≤200mL；能够停用影响排尿功能的药物并进入2周导入期稳定背景治疗。","quote_sha256":"75a779f0e8cc964ab58ef863a0341ffe1dedc6e0ec6193ee85c334e0832b2410","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"排除标准模块：近3个月内膀胱肉毒毒素注射或膀胱灌注治疗；压力性尿失禁为主或混合性尿失禁以压力性为主；残留尿>200mL或尿潴留史；未控制的糖尿病（HbA1c>8.5%）或泌尿系活动性感染；筛选期QTcF>450ms；妊娠或哺乳期。","quote_sha256":"f041715aa170be9d675d85314c9689405d86d1887f2d124e5b26b2d8080b8cd6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_exclusion"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span_project_inclusion","span_project_exclusion"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目妊娠事件报告与随访管理文件后完成本章节。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_pregnancy_001","missing_source_classes":["妊娠事件报告与随访项目文件"],"target":"8.8 妊娠事件的报告与随访"}],"heading":"妊娠事件的报告与随访","missing_source_classes":["妊娠事件报告与随访项目文件","妊娠管理流程文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究入组人群为18-80岁男性或绝经后/有避孕措施的女性，妊娠或哺乳期女性不符合入选条件。妊娠事件的报告与随访范围覆盖研究期间妊娠事件的识别、记录、报告以及随访至妊娠结局。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的入选人群和妊娠或哺乳期排除标准撰写；妊娠事件的报告对象、时限、随访方式、新生儿随访和避孕方法缺少项目文件，不能从排除标准推断，需医学确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（妊娠事件的报告与随访）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_076014fb5ce7c9d1","section_number":"8.8","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9691f7c94f6c58","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9895ed0bd2ffd4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929225633_649743cb","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"估计目标策略：主要估计目标采用治疗政策策略：以第8周平均每日排尿次数自基线变化为终点，无论是否启用急救抗毒蕈碱药物均纳入分析；人群为FAS（ITT原则）；以基线排尿次数与研究中心为协变量。","quote_sha256":"b6e2ab92c3b407c521c1b207df661c9fbbb6681bae6bd9d3bcf7c92b3898ab41","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"统计分析策略：主要分析：第8周平均每日排尿次数变化采用MMRM（治疗组、访视、基线值、研究中心为固定效应）；三组比较采用Holm程序控制族第一类错误；缺失数据敏感性分析采用多重插补与tipping-point；安全性采用SS集描述性汇总。","quote_sha256":"071f18e948551b0419e51e20753c0c35095b200d01f09f23597e3a79afdc35b4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_statistical_analysis"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"安全性终点：TEAE发生率与严重程度（全治疗期随访）；生命体征与体重（每次访视）；12导联心电图与QTc（基线、第4周、第8周）；临床实验室检查（血常规、血生化、尿常规，基线与第8周）；残余尿量（B超，基线与第8周）","quote_sha256":"66c6ed21768e222442148668c8e011f2fdd1d5362d40c19cd49dd66faeaf5df6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_safety_endpoint"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span_project_estimand","span_project_statistical_analysis","span_project_safety_endpoint"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"统计分析","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究统计分析遵循预先规定的分析策略。主要估计目标采用治疗政策策略，以第8周平均每日排尿次数自基线变化为终点，无论是否启用急救抗毒蕈碱药物均纳入分析；分析人群为FAS（ITT原则），以基线排尿次数与研究中心为协变量。主要分析采用MMRM，固定效应包括治疗组、访视、基线值和研究中心；三组比较采用Holm程序控制族第一类错误。缺失数据敏感性分析采用多重插补与tipping-point方法。安全性分析采用SS集进行描述性汇总，涵盖TEAE发生率与严重程度、生命体征与体重、12导联心电图与QTc、临床实验室检查以及残余尿量等安全性终点。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的估计目标策略和统计分析策略撰写，包括FAS（ITT原则）、治疗政策策略、MMRM固定效应、Holm程序、缺失数据敏感性分析和SS集安全性描述性汇总。医学作者需复核分析集定义与敏感性分析细节与最终方案的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（统计分析）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_1bace1b8371c665e","section_number":"9","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9691f7c94f6c58","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9895ed0bd2ffd4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929225633_649743cb","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"样本量策略：按主要终点组间差值1.5次/24h、标准差3.2次估算，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%，按15%脱落率放大，每组60例、共180例。","quote_sha256":"c6098a40c0d12415b5db9a4f2388ddea32acfd0e1c9a1611421eeff5cf6510bb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_sample_size"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_4a05ffc7d3f96141:full-draft:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","quote":"按主要终点组间差值1.5次/24h、标准差3.2次估算，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%，按15%脱落率放大，每组60例、共180例。","quote_sha256":"b6078fef8d38857b1f2a5e00157893d5b64a6623438e40b1f0fa4dd7d3541a88","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","span_id":"span_selection_sample_size"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:revision:5","quote":"试验组与对照组：R2RT-OAB-201 40mg Bid组；R2RT-OAB-201 80mg Bid组；安慰剂组","quote_sha256":"c2f3518cde2aae027697ecc5be578c72bffc46cab1a81a0bf8df7d88dde726fa","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","span_id":"span_project_treatment_groups"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span_project_sample_size","span_selection_sample_size","span_project_treatment_groups"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[],"heading":"样本量","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"样本量按主要终点组间差值1.5次/24h、标准差3.2次估算，采用双侧α=0.05、把握度90%，考虑15%脱落率后每组60例，共180例。本研究设置R2RT-OAB-201 40mg Bid组、R2RT-OAB-201 80mg Bid组和安慰剂组，三组共计180例。","rationale":"正文依据已确认的样本量策略和已有样本量正文撰写；效应量、标准差、脱落率和例数均为已确认数值，医学作者需确认样本量假设的临床合理性。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（样本量）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_e138be6af285ab15","section_number":"9.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_819d27514610a49ffa96:r5:e7d77be2f0e0393a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:f386be5d8f9bc2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9691f7c94f6c58","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:5cb5f7385bb976","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9895ed0bd2ffd4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:ac6ee929ab7d83"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"c44903d35c7bcacb27022cd33a689510b1b69645c44ba5899f1da6b60cd66489","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_e068895908c9_4a05ffc7d3f96141:full-draft:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d3b18d3c5bc2f2e1d9d8c0eb4f67a10dedd24555da25190a36aa87465b6205da:19c0946cd0fefc1c758c67ab","text_sha256":"c44903d35c7bcacb27022cd33a689510b1b69645c44ba5899f1da6b60cd66489"},{"content_sha256":"0